### `commit()`
*Commit the agent's library source-code to the MCP's repository for live use.*

Re-reads the recorded source_path, validates (structure + the
single-`main` contract + reserved terms + the summary-length rule),
and rebuilds the generated index + docs. Idempotent (a no-change resync
returns all-empty). Returns the changed paths grouped by kind; rejects
with `library::violations`.

#### arguments

Schema (partial):
```json
{
  "properties": {
    "library": { "type": "string" }
  },
  "required": ["library"]
}
```

#### Example

MCP (partial):
```json
{
  "arguments": { "library": "geo" }
}
```

Output (partial):
```json
{
  "result": {
    "structuredContent": {
      "added": ["geo/shape/area.nu", "geo/shape/mod.nu"],
      "modified": ["geo/mod.nu"],
      "removed": []
    },
    "content": []
  }
}
```

